1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Three resume fixes you can make before your next application.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,500
One. Name the file with your name, not resume final version three.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Two. Put your contact info in the body. Some systems misread headers.

4
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Three. Swap duties for numbers. This one's an example, use your real ones.

5
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
And never invent numbers. If you can't explain it in an interview, delete it.

6
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Follow for more.
